# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ALLOWLIST, NOT A BLOCKLIST.
#
# Everything is ignored by default. Files enter this repository only when a
# line below explicitly lets them in.
#
# Why: with a blocklist, a new file leaks by forgetting. With an allowlist, a
# new file stays out until someone decides otherwise. The cost is remembering
# to add a line, and that is the right cost to pay.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# 1. Ignore everything.
*

# 2. But still descend into directories, so the rules below can match.
!*/

# 3. Explicitly allowed files.
!.gitignore
!README.md
!METHOD.md
!LICENSE
!NOTICE.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!docs/**/*.md
!examples/**/*.md
!assets/**/*.png
!assets/**/*.svg

# 4. Never, under any circumstance.
*.env
*.key
*.pem
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
